## Key Findings
- **a2acw-the-actual-discovery.md**: A2ACW is the actual discovery of the
  Synchronism project. The physics is reparametrization (0 unique predictions, all
  4 tracks converge on known results). The methodology is novel (institutionalized
  friction, quantitative health metrics, role asymmetry, external verification
  requirement). The 47 genuine contributions are statistical tools and methods, not
  physics. The site leads with the physics and buries the methodology — this is
  backwards.

